{"id":"99228862-95b8-4f8b-8eec-5c5062345814","title":"Shifted Swirls 3","slug":"shifted-swirls-3","collectionSlug":"shifted-swirls","collectionName":"Shifted Swirls","category":"background","categoryZh":"背景动画","description":"A smooth, flowing gradient shader effect dominated by purple and magenta tones with a radial gradient structure. The composition features a deep dark purple (#1f004a) at the center that transitions outward through a vibrant medium purple (#853799) to a soft, light pink (#fcbaff) at the edges. The effect is characterized by subtle wave-like distortions created by the ripple component with a frequency of 8.3, which creates gentle undulating patterns across the surface. A displacement map with 0.3 amount applies subtle warping to the ripple pattern, creating organic fluid-like movement. The pixel throw effect with 0.5 strength adds fine granular texture and slight spatial displacement, particularly noticeable in the luminance areas, creating a soft, ethereal quality. The overall atmosphere is dreamy and atmospheric with soft edges and smooth color transitions. The radial gradient has an aspect ratio of 0.5 and radius of 1.5, creating an elongated oval shape that dominates the composition. The blend mode is set to normal with full opacity, and the tone mapping uses ACES for enhanced color grading. The effect has a liquid, flowing quality with no harsh edges or defined geometry.","colors":["#1f004a","#853799","#fcbaff","#ffffff"],"labels":["gradient","organic","calm","vibrant"],"cover":"/shaders/covers/99228862-95b8-4f8b-8eec-5c5062345814.jpg","toneMapping":"aces","components":[{"type":"Ripples","id":"idmsx81sj7r8hp63y3d","_key":"key_msx81sj7r8hp63y3d","props":{"phase":0,"speed":1,"center":{"x":-0.0004889703077920592,"y":0},"colorA":"#ffffff","colorB":"#000000","opacity":1,"maskType":"alpha","softness":1.1,"blendMode":"normal","frequency":8.3,"thickness":0.5,"transform":{"edges":"transparent","scale":1,"anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"offsetX":0,"offsetY